      </div>

      <div class="lower-section">
        <div class="section-split">
          <div class="split-column">
            <div class="section-title">Planning for the whole team?</div>
            <a href="#contact" class="green-button"
              ><span class="button-text">Contact Us</span></a
            >
          </div>
          <div class="split-column">
            <div class="section-title">Personal or family booking?</div>
            <a href="/api/login" class="green-button"
              ><span class="button-text">Sign in / Sign up</span></a
            >
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="browse-text">Just want to browse? Start here</div>

        <div class="package-section">
          <div class="package-image"></div>
          <div class="package-details">
            <div class="package-title">The Bali Package</div>
            <div class="package-duration">4 days 4 nights</div>
            <p class="package-description">
              Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. Massa mauris nunc ornare
              est ultrices vulputate. Nullam imperdiet at faucibus lorem
