          </div>
        </div>

        <section
          id="about"
          class="about-section"
          style="margin-top: 100px; margin-bottom: 100px"
        >
          <h2
            class="section-title"
            style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3rem"
          >
            About ThePalmWay
          </h2>
          <div
            class="about-content"
            style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center"
          >
            <p
              style="
                font-size: 1.2rem;
                line-height: 1.8;
                margin-bottom: 2rem;
                color: #e0e0e0;
              "
            >
              Welcome to ThePalmWay, your trusted partner in creating
              unforgettable travel experiences. We specialize in curating
