              unique preferences and needs.
            </p>
            <div
              class="about-features"
              style="
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
                gap: 2rem;
                margin-top: 3rem;
              "
            >
              <div
                class="feature-card"
                style="
                  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
                  padding: 2rem;
                  border-radius: 15px;
                  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
                "
              >
                <div style="font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1rem">🌴</div>
                <h3
                  style="
                    font-size: 1.3rem;
                    margin-bottom: 1rem;
                    font-weight: 600;
                  "
                >
                  Exotic Destinations
                </h3>
                <p style="color: #c0c0c0; line-height: 1.6">
                  Discover breathtaking locations from Bali to Switzerland,
                  carefully selected for their beauty and cultural richness.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div
                class="feature-card"
                style="
                  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
                  padding: 2rem;
                  border-radius: 15px;
                  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
                "
              >
                <div style="font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1rem">✈</div>
                <h3
                  style="
                    font-size: 1.3rem;
                    margin-bottom: 1rem;
                    font-weight: 600;
                  "
                >
                  Seamless Booking
                </h3>
                <p style="color: #c0c0c0; line-height: 1.6">
                  Our easy-to-use platform makes booking your dream vacation
                  simple and stress-free.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div
                class="feature-card"
                style="
                  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
                  padding: 2rem;
                  border-radius: 15px;
                  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
                "
              >
                <div style="font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1rem">🏨</div>
                <h3
                  style="
                    font-size: 1.3rem;
                    margin-bottom: 1rem;
                    font-weight: 600;
                  "
                >
                  Premium Accommodations
                </h3>
                <p style="color: #c0c0c0; line-height: 1.6">
                  Stay in handpicked hotels and resorts that offer comfort,
                  luxury, and authentic local experiences.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="contact" class="my-24 px-[5%]">
          <div
            class="mx-auto max-w-6xl overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-white/5 p-12 text-white backdrop-blur-md md:p-16 lg:flex lg:flex-nowrap lg:items-center lg:gap-16"
          >
            <div class="flex min-w-[300px] basis-[40%] justify-center">
              <img
                src="assets/images/contact-illustration.svg"
